 maar de moerbeibomen willen niet groeien in de grond. Hun opdracht loopt vast en de overheid biedt weinig uitkomst. Silas staat eerst afwijzend tegenover de nieuwkomers, maar gaat hun situatie steeds beter begrijpen. De roman volgt hoe een mislukte onderneming de levens van bewoners en immigranten verbindt en hoe verantwoordelijkheid kan ontstaan tegenover mensen die aanvankelijk vreemden waren.","work_id":987147027,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain Work5898 Moerbeibos / Dalene Matthee; exact Dutch Moerbeibos ISBN 9789088653230 Paperback. KB exact-title, author and original-title references compared with the existing source-edition parent. Reuse original content review content-review-032.json. No new Work, changed first-publication year, merged author, additional Dutch availability or taste classification is proposed.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p372584586"],"reference":"work:5898","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.993Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-032.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2412103W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p372584586"]},{"note":"Exact bound prior bulk-source attempt retained. No verified asset imported; existing shared resolver retained. Hosted exact-edition decoded front or documentedneutralplaceholder stillrequired.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789088653230","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15107000,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:35:36.997Z","editionKey":"/books/OL59668946M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source